{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43494","headline":"听霜钟 · 无名氏","name":"听霜钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺飞霜夜，寥寥远岫钟。\n出云疑断续，入户乍舂容。\n度枕频惊梦，随风几韵松。\n悠扬来不已，杳霭去何从。\n髣髴烟岚隔，依俙岩峤重。\n此时聊一听，余响绕千峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}